%%{init: {"theme": "neutral"} }%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor M as Merchant
    participant S as ShelfScanPage<br/>(ShelfScanCubit)
    participant R as ScanReviewView<br/>(ScanReviewCubit)
    participant A as apps/api vision
    participant C as apps/api catalog

    M->>S: take or pick a shelf photo (image_picker, 2560 px JPEG)
    S-->>M: phone's own checks (dark, blurry, glare on a 320 px copy)
    S->>A: POST …/vision/photo-check (≤ 1 MB copy)
    A-->>S: { verdict, issues, instruction, productsVisible, labelsLegible }
    S-->>M: verdict pill and advice (never blocks the scan)
    alt Start stock-take (agent)
        S->>A: POST …/vision/stocktakes (multipart image)
        A-->>S: 202 { runId }
        loop every 1.5 s, until not running (gives up at 6 min)
            S->>A: GET …/stocktakes/:runId
            A-->>S: { run.status, steps[], result }
            S-->>M: live step trace
        end
        Note right of S: fallback = the first pass, flagged in review
    else Quick scan
        S->>A: POST …/vision/shelf-scans (multipart image)
        A-->>S: { scanId, detections[] } (~15–30 s)
    end
    S->>R: scan + photo
    R-->>M: photo with outlines and unread parts shaded, one line per product
    M->>R: action, count, product, name and price per line
    opt product picker: other sizes or a catalogue search
        R->>C: GET /catalog/products/:qid (variants) · GET /catalog/products?q=&limit=10
        C-->>R: products, and a picked one is fetched for its name and price
    end
    Note right of R: nothing is stocked until Confirm
    M->>R: Stock N items, U units
    R->>A: POST …/shelf-scans/:scanId/confirm { decisions[] } (every line, skips too)
    A-->>R: { created, restocked, restored, skipped, invalid, feedback }
    R-->>M: outcome, then the inventory reloads
